Grainhouse includes these models and data:

- YOLO11n-seg and YOLO11n-pose by Ultralytics, AGPL-3.0 (https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics),
  converted to Grainhouse's own format. Because of them, Grainhouse is distributed under the AGPL-3.0 as well.
- MediaPipe face detector (BlazeFace short range), face landmark model and face mesh edge list by Google,
  Apache-2.0 (https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe).
- Real-ESRGAN (RealESRGAN_x4plus, realesr-general-x4v3, realesr-general-wdn-x4v3) by Xintao Wang et al.,
  BSD-3-Clause (https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN), converted to ONNX by tools/esrgan_to_onnx.py.

It is built with, among others:

- rawler (LGPL-2.1) for RAW files, https://github.com/dnglab/dnglab
- ONNX Runtime (MIT) through the ort crate (MIT/Apache-2.0), https://github.com/pykeio/ort
- GTK 4 and libadwaita (LGPL-2.1 or later)
- image, rayon, serde (MIT/Apache-2.0)
